sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Delegating as Delegating Agent
  participant Runtime as Runtime module
  participant Repository as TaskRepository
  participant Worker as Worker Agent

  Delegating->>Runtime: dispatch round(roundId)
  Runtime->>Repository: persist round_started(sequence, roundId)
  Runtime->>Worker: run(roundId)
  Worker-->>Runtime: ack(roundId)

  loop Every 5 seconds while working
    Worker-->>Runtime: heartbeat(roundId)
  end

  Worker-->>Runtime: events(roundId)
  Worker-->>Runtime: result or error(roundId)
  Runtime->>Repository: persist round_finished(sequence, roundId)
  Worker-->>Runtime: released(roundId)
  Runtime-->>Delegating: next round allowed

  Note over Runtime,Worker: No rework or Provider fallback before released
  Note over Runtime: Stale, duplicate, and old roundId messages are ignored
